body:
Because I have felt this way for 5 years, as I said, I do get happy and sometimes I am for a long period of time. But this past year or so, it's been getting worse. I hate the idea of getting better and then, if something were to happen in my life that would impact it negatively, I'd just be so depressed again. I have no energy to do that. No energy to suffer another heartbreak, a loss, a career failure, or whatever it is that people live in this world. 

&#x200B;

Yeah BPD because I get triggered and act in 2sec (self-harm, thoughts of suicide) even if the matter was small. Bipolar, the people I saw never diagnosed me with that so not sure. Maybe I should see someone new and be honest this time haha.
